WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,210
Okay, my dear friend, my name is Master Chu.

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:06,810
Brother, you worked hard up the mountain and didn’t eat today?

3
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:10,610
We are busy on the road to the handyman canteen, although there are not many vegetable markets.

4
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:14,690
But just one is good. That’s enough. I took a big bucket.

5
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:19,540
After all, we handymen are pretty much disciples to say the least.

6
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:23,500
In fact, I'm just here to work. If I don't have enough to eat, I won't have the energy.

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,270
Thank you, man. I already had it on the way.

8
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:33,900
My dear boy is still a member of the First Street Standing Committee.

9
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:37,200
This thing is not easy to catch. Brother, you are awesome.

10
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:41,260
Maybe it’s because I’ve been hunting since I was a kid. Let’s eat together, my dear friends.

11
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,460
I happen to be in and out of the sect, and there are still many things I don’t understand.

12
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,820
I still need to ask my dear friend for advice

13
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,500
You're welcome, haha

14
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,940
You already call me brother. Can you take good care of you?
